OL,3,GNEWSAData centre demand drives NI
OL,4,Amanufacturing boom
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemand for data centre equipment
OL,7,Fappears to be driving a boom in
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland manufacturing, new
OL,9,Fofficial figures suggest.
OL,11,FNI manufacturing grew at an annual rate
OL,12,Fof 9% in the second quarter of this
OL,13,Fyear, compared to a UK average of just
OL,14,F1.2%.
OL,16,FNI has been outperforming the UK
OL,17,Faverage since the start of last year.
