OL,3,GNEWSAData centre demand drives NI
OL,4,Amanufacturing boom
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe growth in NI has been concentrated
OL,7,Fin "computer, electronic, electrical,
OL,8,Fand optical products" which grew at an
OL,9,Fannual rate of almost 28% in the most
OL,10,Frecent quarter.
